---
import { isCorePathReleased, resolveCityLink } from '../utils/service-area-cities';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from './Breadcrumbs.astro';
import services from '../data/services.json';
import topics from '../data/compact-services.json';
import images from '../data/compact-service-images.json';
import { compactServiceUrl } from '../utils/compact-city-pages';
interface Props {city:{name:string;slug:string;county:string;officialWebsite?:string}}
const {city} = Astro.props;
const heading = `Property damage restoration in ${city.name}`;
const description = `${heading}, Texas. Arrange help with water, mold, fire, sewage damage, and reconstruction with Go Green Restoration TX Inc.`;
const path = `/locations/dfw-metro/${city.slug}/`;
const image = images['emergency-water-extraction'];
const draft = !isCorePathReleased(path);
const officialWebsite = city.officialWebsite && /^https:\/\//.test(city.officialWebsite) ? city.officialWebsite : undefined;
const problems = {
  'water-damage-restoration':'Water is still standing, finishes are damp, or a leak has spread into another room. We will review extraction, affected materials, and drying before repairs.',
  'mold-remediation':'You have found growth after a leak or behind damaged finishes. We will discuss the moisture source, assessment information, and the provider responsible for the scope.',
  'fire-smoke-damage-restoration':'Smoke residue, damaged materials, or firefighting water are keeping you out of part of the property. We will explain stabilization, cleaning, and repair dependencies.',
  'sewage-backup-cleanup':'Wastewater has reached flooring or adjoining rooms. We will separate cleanup from the plumbing repair and explain affected-material decisions.',
  'construction-remodeling':'Cleanup is finished but walls, ceilings, flooring, or cabinets need repair. We will review readiness and define the reconstruction scope with you.'
};
---
<BaseLayout title={`${heading} | Request an Estimate | Go Green Restoration TX Inc`} description={description} noindex={draft} omitOfficeCopy={true} schema={[{'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'WebPage',name:heading,url:`https://gogreenrestorationtx.com${path}`,about:{'@type':'Service',name:'Property damage restoration',areaServed:{'@type':'City',name:`${city.name}, Texas`}}}]}>
  <Breadcrumbs items={[{name:'Home',url:'/'},{name:'DFW service areas',url:'/locations/dfw-metro/'},{name:city.name,url:path}]} />
  {draft && <aside class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 pt-4 text-sm text-brand-gray-600">Local review draft · not published or submitted for indexing. <a href="/city-service-preview/" class="underline">Browse city drafts</a></aside>}
  <article class="expanded-hub max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-10 lg:py-14">
    <header>
      <h1 class="font-heading text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold mb-6">{heading}</h1>
      <p data-uniqueness class="text-lg mb-6 max-w-3xl">{heading} helps when a leak, fire, wastewater overflow, or mold problem has left rooms damaged and you need a clear next step. You may need cleanup now, a plan for hidden moisture, or repairs after material removal. We will review the situation, explain the proposed work, and confirm availability for your address.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 mb-8"><a class="bg-brand-green text-white font-bold rounded-lg px-6 py-4 text-center" href="tel:+14697273217">Call (469) 727-3217</a><a class="bg-brand-brown text-white font-bold rounded-lg px-6 py-4 text-center" href="/contact/">Request an estimate</a></div>
      <figure class="mb-10"><img src={image.src} srcset={`${image.smallSrc} 640w, ${image.src} 1280w`} sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 960px" alt={image.alt} width={image.width} height={image.height} fetchpriority="high" class="w-full rounded-xl" /><figcaption class="text-sm text-brand-gray-600 mt-2">Higgsfield-generated restoration illustration; not a photograph of a completed {city.name} project.</figcaption></figure>
    </header>
    <section data-uniqueness><h2>{heading}: choose the help you need</h2><p>You do not need to know every restoration term before contacting us. Tell us what happened, which spaces are affected, and whether the source is still active. These service pages explain the decisions most relevant to your situation.</p><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">{services.map(service => <div class="rounded-xl bg-brand-gray-50 p-5"><h3 class="font-bold text-xl mb-3"><a href={resolveCityLink(`/${service.slug}/${city.slug}/`)}>{service.name} in {city.name}</a></h3><p>{problems[service.slug as keyof typeof problems]}</p></div>)}</div></section>
    <section data-uniqueness><h2>What we will establish at the first visit</h2><p>We will review the accessible damage, source-repair status, and materials that may need further evaluation. We will explain the proposed cleanup or repair scope and identify any separate provider responsibilities before work begins.</p><ul><li>The areas affected and any spaces that need access restrictions.</li><li>Source repairs already completed or still outstanding.</li><li>Materials proposed for cleaning, drying, removal, or replacement.</li><li>Who can approve the work and how progress will be communicated.</li></ul></section>
    <section data-uniqueness><h2>A clear sequence from cleanup to reconstruction</h2><p>Stopping a leak or clearing a blockage does not finish the restoration of damaged materials. We will record progress, explain the cleanup and drying status, and identify what needs to happen before repairs and reconstruction begin.</p><p>If visible growth or moisture concerns require a mold scope, we will explain that step before new finishes cover the area. Assessment, remediation, and independent clearance are separate services; the applicable scope and provider will be identified.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Services for specific damage and affected spaces</h2><p>Use the links below for a more focused explanation of the work, estimate factors, and information to share when arranging a visit.</p>{services.map(service => {const group=topics.filter(topic=>topic.parent===service.slug);return group.length > 0 && <div class="mb-6"><h3 class="font-bold text-xl mb-3">{service.shortName}</h3><ul class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-x-8">{group.map(topic=><li><a href={resolveCityLink(compactServiceUrl(topic.slug,city.slug))}>{topic.name} in {city.name}</a></li>)}</ul></div>})}</section>
    <section data-uniqueness><h2>Arrange access and discuss the estimate</h2><p>Send the property address in {city.name}, the affected rooms, photographs if available, and any access instructions. For a rental or managed building, identify the person who can approve the scope and the person who will meet the team.</p><p>The estimate depends on the damage, material layers, access, removal needs, and work already completed. We will explain the proposed scope and discuss changes if the evaluation reveals additional damage.</p>{officialWebsite && <p>The <a href={resolveCityLink(officialWebsite)}>official {city.name} website</a> provides municipal information. Project-specific requirements will be checked with the relevant authority as needed.</p>}</section>
    <p class="text-sm text-brand-gray-600 border-t pt-6 mb-8">Go Green Restoration TX Inc welcomes mold projects of any size. While our Texas mold remediation license application is pending, work requiring a license is referred to appropriately licensed partner companies. The provider and scope of work are identified before work begins. Independent assessment and clearance are separate services.</p>
    <section class="bg-brand-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6"><h2>Tell us what happened at your property</h2><p>Call <a href="tel:+14697273217">(469) 727-3217</a> or <a href="/contact/">send a service request</a>. We will discuss the condition, confirm availability for the address, and explain the next step.</p><p>For the wider service area, see our <a href="/locations/dfw-metro/">Dallas–Fort Worth directory</a>.</p></section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .expanded-hub section{margin-bottom:2.25rem}.expanded-hub h2{font-size:1.5rem;line-height:1.3;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:1rem;color:#1f2937}.expanded-hub p{line-height:1.8;color:#4b5563;margin-bottom:1rem}.expanded-hub section a{color:#775130;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}.expanded-hub ul{list-style:disc;padding-left:1.4rem;margin-bottom:1.25rem}.expanded-hub li{margin-bottom:.55rem;line-height:1.65}@media(max-width:480px){.expanded-hub h1{font-size:2.1rem}.expanded-hub h2{font-size:1.4rem}}
</style>
